<h2 id="incl-h">What the price includes.</h2>
<ul class="plain-list">
<li><b>The session itself</b>, at the agreed length.</li>
<li><b>Travel within the service area.</b> There's no additional mileage charge — what you see is what you pay, wherever in the area you are. Remote sessions are the same rate, with nothing added or taken off.</li>
<li><b>Planning and preparation</b> between sessions — thinking about your child, adapting what we're doing, sourcing or making materials.</li>
<li><b>Coordination with your other providers</b> where you'd like it — early intervention, your school district, a speech therapist, your pediatrician.</li>
</ul>
<h2 class="mt">What isn't included.</h2>
<ul class="plain-list">
<li>Fees charged by a community program for me to attend alongside your child.</li>
<li>Equipment or materials bought specifically for your home, if we decide something is worth having.</li>
<li>Formal diagnostic assessment — that's a different process, usually through your pediatrician.</li>
</ul>
