<div><h3>Confidentiality</h3><p>What you tell me about your family stays between us. I'll only share information with another provider — your pediatrician, your school district, a therapist — with your agreement.</p><p>The one limit, and it applies to every licensed therapist in {{ site.licenseState }}: I'm a mandated reporter. If I have reasonable cause to believe a child is being abused or neglected, I'm required by law to report it. That obligation sits above confidentiality, and I'd rather you heard it here than discovered it later.</p></div>
